{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#card-zh","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 是 DSH Web 的插件管理界面，在设置页把插件清单分为系统、WebUI、工具、用户扩展和临时运行等类别。它读取运行中的 Loader 与 profile 配置，提供名称和描述搜索、状态及未生效原因展示；用户扩展可启停或卸载，插件描述可编辑保存。适合需要辨认已安装扩展来源、查看运行状态并整理 Web profile 的 DSH 管理者。安装为 bundle 插件后，在 DSH Web 设置的插件管理页使用；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:767-869","lib/index.js:870-925","lib/index.js:940-1070","lib/client.js:730-796"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#card-en","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pluginmanager groups DSH Web plugins by system, UI, tools, user extensions and temporary entries. Its settings view searches the live inventory, shows status and inactive reasons, and lets users toggle or uninstall extensions and edit descriptions. Install as a bundle; no API key needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:767-869","lib/index.js:870-925","lib/index.js:940-1070","lib/client.js:730-796"]}
