{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#feature-1","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 的功能「分类浏览」：在 DSH Web 设置页按系统、WebUI、工具、用户扩展和临时插件分组展示条目，并显示启停状态。打开设置中的插件管理页即可查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:767-869","lib/client.js:620-710"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#feature-2","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 的功能「搜索过滤」：按插件名称、显示名称、描述或来源筛选清单。用户在插件管理页的搜索框输入关键词即可过滤结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:217-223","lib/client.js:620-630"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#feature-3","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 的功能「启用与停用」：用户扩展可通过操作按钮切换状态，服务端写入 cordis.patch.yml 并尝试同步更新运行中的 Loader 条目。用户在对应插件行选择启用或停用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:870-925","lib/client.js:580-598"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#feature-4","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 的功能「描述编辑」：用户可为插件保存自定义显示名称和说明，内容写入 profile 下的 descriptions.json。通过插件行的编辑描述表单提交保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1057-1070","lib/index.js:43-47","lib/client.js:290-350"]}
{"unit_id":"buhuikongpan__dsh-pluginmanager#feature-5","repo":"buhuikongpan/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"de79f77748d0a60106650cfb37d9ce020663171d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 的功能「扩展卸载」：用户扩展可从清单发起卸载，服务端清理激活配置及描述，并按来源处理运行态；bundle 扩展会提示需要重启。用户点击卸载并确认后执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:940-1055","lib/client.js:590-598"]}
